# Reference: Worksheet API Contract (skeleton)

Base path: `/api/trading/v1/worksheets`. Turn this into a real OpenAPI 3.1 file in Phase 1
(`api/worksheet-api.yaml`) and generate the TypeScript clients for both UIs from it.

## Common headers
| Header | Direction | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `Authorization: Bearer <token>` | req | Wove/NetX token; facade exchanges for NetX identity |
| `X-Channel: NETX \| WOVE` | req | Audit + per-channel kill switch |
| `X-Correlation-Id` | req/resp | End-to-end tracing |
| `If-Match: <version>` | req (mutations) | Optimistic lock |
| `ETag: <version>` | resp | Current worksheet version |
| `Idempotency-Key` | req (create, submit) | Safe retries |

## Endpoints
| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/` | Create worksheet (type, accounts, optional seed lines/model) |
| GET | `/?status=&owner=&account=&page=` | List worksheets visible to user |
| GET | `/{id}` | Full worksheet with lines and messages |
| PATCH | `/{id}` | Worksheet-level edits (name, notes, settings) |
| POST | `/{id}/lines` | Add lines (batch) |
| PATCH | `/{id}/lines/{lineId}` | Edit a line |
| DELETE | `/{id}/lines/{lineId}` | Remove a line |
| POST | `/{id}/generate` | Backend generates lines from model / cash target (rebalance) |
| POST | `/{id}/allocations` | Set block allocation (BLOCK) |
| POST | `/{id}/validate` | Run all validation layers; returns messages + status |
| POST | `/{id}/acknowledgements` | Acknowledge WARNING messages by code/lineId |
| POST | `/{id}/submit` | Submit (idempotent); returns per-line order refs or PENDING_APPROVAL |
| POST | `/{id}/approve` / `/reject` | Supervisory action |
| POST | `/{id}/cancel` | Cancel worksheet |
| GET | `/{id}/audit` | Audit trail |
| GET | `/lookups/securities?q=` | Security search (shared so both UIs match) |
| GET | `/lookups/accounts?q=` | Accounts the user can trade |

## Error model (RFC 7807 problem+json)
```json
{ "type": "https://errors/.../version-conflict", "title": "Worksheet changed",
  "status": 409, "code": "WS_VERSION_CONFLICT", "correlationId": "…",
  "detail": "Worksheet was modified by another session.", "currentVersion": 14 }
```
Standard codes: `WS_NOT_FOUND` 404, `WS_FORBIDDEN` 403, `WS_VERSION_CONFLICT` 409,
`WS_INVALID_STATE` 409, `WS_VALIDATION_FAILED` 422, `WS_STALE_VALIDATION` 422,
`WS_CHANNEL_DISABLED` 503, `WS_DOWNSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE` 503.

## Events (Kafka topic `trading.worksheet.events`, pushed to UIs via SSE/WebSocket)
Envelope: `{ eventId, type, worksheetId, version, occurredAt, channel, actorUserId, correlationId, payload }`
Types: `worksheet.created`, `worksheet.updated`, `worksheet.validated`, `worksheet.submitted`,
`worksheet.approval_required`, `worksheet.cancelled`, `worksheet.expired`,
`order.status_changed` (per line: accepted, partially_filled, filled, rejected).
UIs treat events as "refetch hints": on an event with `version` > local version, GET the worksheet.
Never apply event payloads as the source of truth for editing.


